Scenario C: Fairness or Starvation-Sensitive Case

 Input Data:
o P1: Arrival=0, Burst=10, Priority=10 (Long & Low Priority)
o P2: Arrival=1, Burst=2, Priority=1
o P3: Arrival=2, Burst=1, Priority=2

Description

"This scenario demonstrates starvation risks.
In SJF Preemptive, P1 suffers the most as it is constantly interrupted by shorter jobs.
